  "_README": [
    "Reference `quantization_config` blocks for config.json, one per plan-09 policy.",
    "Consumed by tools/pxq4_gguf/convert.py (component A) and parsed by",
    "PXQ4Config.from_config (component quant-config).",
    "book/sub MUST be copied verbatim from the gguf KVs pxa.pxq6.book / pxa.pxq6.sub;",
    "the values here are ggml-pxq6-tables.h:32-45 evaluated in fp32 and are only a",
    "default -- PXA_PXQ6_BOOK/PXA_PXQ6_SUB can override them at engine build time.",
    "DELTA vs plan 09 sec.5.5: `modules_to_not_convert: [\"mtp\"]` is added.",
    "qwen3_5_mtp.py:447-470 reads that exact key (not `ignore`) to build the",
    "speculative draft branch with quant_config=None; without it a run started with",
    "--speculative-config constructs PXQ4 linears for mtp.* whose weights the P1/P2",
    "converter never emits.",
    "THERE IS NO P2b BLOCK, AND `lm_head` IS IN `ignore` IN ALL OF THEM, ON PURPOSE.",
    "PXQ4Config._validate REJECTS any config whose `pxq4_modules` names lm_head or",
    "embed_tokens (UNSERVABLE_PXQ4_LEAF_MODULES): ParallelLMHead forces its own v1 vocab",
    "weight_loader (vocab_parallel_embedding.py:520-527, :633-682), which cannot slice the",
    "64-row panel layout at TP>1 and cannot fill both pxq4_slabs and pxq4_anchor. The",
    "converter agrees -- namemap.POLICY_MODULES has no lm_head in any policy and",
    "namemap.assert_policy_supported refuses `--policy p2b` by name. A 4-bit head is P3.",
    "CONSEQUENCE FOR THE ECONOMICS: p2c below is 3.616 GiB/GPU/token at TP=4 (the converter's",
    "own bandwidth_report, against the real artifact header), vs the incumbent AWQ's 3.547 --",
    "+1.9% bytes, not plan 09 sec.0's -8.7%. That -8.7% assumed a 4-bit LM head worth 0.435",
    "GiB/GPU. PROJECTION, no GPU was run: p2c lands near 91 tok/s against the incumbent's",
    "MEASURED 92.8 peak. No policy here beats the incumbent on bytes until the P3 head lands.",
    "Also set config.json `dtype`/`torch_dtype` to float16: config/vllm.py:622-627",
    "rejects any model dtype outside get_supported_act_dtypes(), and sm_70 has no bf16."
  ],
